	)
	(text "WAKE TIMER: R12 910k 1%; C23 3.3uF 25V X7R 10% 0805; approx 3 s nominal.\nMeasure PWRON_N LOW for 2.2-3.8 s. RC tolerances alone do NOT guarantee this window.\nUse latched active-low interrupts; repeated edges retrigger U6. See WAKE_PULSE_REPAIR_CN.md."
